{"id":"n86389-1-8","stage":3,"title":"형편 · 情势","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n86389-1-8-1","ko":"일이 바쁘더라도 주말에 시간을 내서 집에 한번 내려오렴.","zh":"就算工作很忙，也请在周末抽时间回家一趟吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"일이","meaning":"事情","explanation":"일：事情；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"2","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"바쁘더라도","meaning":"忙，忙碌，紧张","explanation":"바쁘다：忙，忙碌，紧张；더라도：表示让步：“即使……也……”。","readings":[{"term":"바쁘다","audio":"/audio/23457023f6034aaf6759.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66248","senseId":"1","lemma":"바쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주말에","meaning":"周末","explanation":"주말：周末；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"주말","audio":"/audio/dc80d0fe247835379f4f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"19548","senseId":"1","lemma":"주말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시간을","meaning":"时间，空儿","explanation":"시간：时间，空儿；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"시간","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62841","senseId":"3","lemma":"시간","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내서","meaning":"使生出","explanation":"내다：使生出；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"내다","audio":"/audio/3c7ab23f77767092623c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89906","senseId":"21","lemma":"내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"집에","meaning":"家","explanation":"집：家；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"3","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한번","meaning":"一下","explanation":"한번：一下","readings":[{"term":"한번","audio":"/audio/54e30ff4210956a6d721.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57336","senseId":"2","lemma":"한번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"내려오렴.","meaning":"下，回","explanation":"내려오다：下，回；렴：向亲近的人或晚辈发出指示、劝告或请求。","readings":[{"term":"내려오다","audio":"/audio/35192c2853ec6a6272bb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64559","senseId":"2","lemma":"내려오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"带着某种计划和意图想要实现的对象。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"23457023f6034aaf","term":"바쁘다","zh":"忙，忙碌，紧张","audio":"/audio/23457023f6034aaf6759.mp3","entryId":"66248","definition":"因为要做的事情多或没有时间而无暇顾及其他。","pronunciation":["바쁘다"]},{"id":"dc80d0fe24783537","term":"주말","zh":"周末","audio":"/audio/dc80d0fe247835379f4f.mp3","entryId":"19548","definition":"一周的尽头。","pronunciation":["주말"]},{"id":"4692cef5ac69eb37","term":"시간","zh":"时间，空儿","audio":"/audio/4692cef5ac69eb37bd53.mp3","entryId":"62841","definition":"做某事的空闲。","pronunciation":["시간"]},{"id":"3c7ab23f77767092","term":"내다","zh":"使生出","audio":"/audio/3c7ab23f77767092623c.mp3","entryId":"89906","definition":"使产生做某事的时间或机会。","pronunciation":["내ː다"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"组成家庭而生活的一家子。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"54e30ff4210956a6","term":"한번","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/54e30ff4210956a6d721.mp3","entryId":"57336","definition":"表示把某事当做试验来尝试。","pronunciation":["한번"]},{"id":"35192c2853ec6a62","term":"내려오다","zh":"下，回","audio":"/audio/35192c2853ec6a6272bb.mp3","entryId":"64559","definition":"从首尔等大城市来到地方。","pronunciation":["내려오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4d60f7d1a6958e6a799e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n86389-1-8-2","ko":"네. 형편을 봐서 다음 주쯤 가도록 할게요.","zh":"好的，我会根据情况，大概下周再去。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"형편을","meaning":"情势，情况，情形","explanation":"형편：情势，情况，情形；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"형편","audio":"/audio/fe4c5d364acf7ca442f2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86389","senseId":"1","lemma":"형편","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봐서","meaning":"寻找， 见","explanation":"보다：寻找， 见；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"29","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다음","meaning":"以后，下次","explanation":"다음：以后，下次","readings":[{"term":"다음","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64531","senseId":"5","lemma":"다음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주쯤","meaning":"周，星期","explanation":"주：周，星期；쯤：名词后缀，构成派生名词。","readings":[{"term":"주","audio":"/audio/6234d5b178a8b25809d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46811","senseId":"1","lemma":"주","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가도록","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；도록：表示目的、达到的程度或促使某事发生。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"할게요.","meaning":"表示做前面的动作或希望成为该状态。","explanation":"하다：表示做前面的动作或希望成为该状态。；ㄹ게요：向对方礼貌地表达自己的决定或承诺。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"7","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"fe4c5d364acf7ca4","term":"형편","zh":"情势，情况，情形","audio":"/audio/fe4c5d364acf7ca442f2.mp3","entryId":"86389","definition":"事情发展的状况。","pronunciation":["형편"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"寻找， 见","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"观察机会、时间、时机是否适当。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"aef613c6612d424a","term":"다음","zh":"以后，下次","audio":"/audio/aef613c6612d424ab454.mp3","entryId":"64531","definition":"一段时间后。","pronunciation":["다음"]},{"id":"6234d5b178a8b258","term":"주","zh":"周，星期","audio":"/audio/6234d5b178a8b25809d8.mp3","entryId":"46811","definition":"从周一至周日七天为一周期计算的时间单位。","pronunciation":["주"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"从一个地方移动到另一个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示做前面的动作或希望成为该状态。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"表示做前面的动作或希望成为该状态。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9d7c3fe96b1ef9b3032d.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.976,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=86389","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":119,"sequenceScore":3.2794,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["好的，我会根据情况，大概下周再去。","就算工作很忙，也请在周末抽时间回家一趟吧。","我们儿子太不听话了。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["就算工作很忙，也请在周末抽时间回家一趟吧。","我们儿子太不听话了。","好的，我会根据情况，大概下周再去。"],"answer":2}]}
